U6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-09-21T19:39:32Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T19:03:07Z","closed_at":"2025-09-22T18:14:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Debian GNU/Linux 12 (bookworm) 12 on X11 - X11 display driver, Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB (nvidia) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4770 CPU @ 3.40GHz (8 threads) - 7.67 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nDefining a signal in an abstract class (and not using it within that abstract class) results in a warning.\n\n```\nLine 5 (UNUSED_SIGNAL):The signal \"my_signal\" is declared but never explicitly used in the class.\n```\n\nThe warning is accurate, however an abstract class is not typically a _complete_ implementation of itself.\n\n#### Reason this is an issue\n\nI want to define a signal in an abstract class, keep [DRY](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Don%27t_repeat_yourself) and benefit from autocomplete when connecting to it. i.e.\n\n```gdscript\n@export var myClass: MyAbstractClass\n\nfunc _ready():\n    myClass.mySignal.connect(...)\n\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\n@abstract\nclass_name MyClass\nextends Resource\n\nsignal my_signal\n```\n```\nLine 5 (UNUSED_SIGNAL):The signal \"my_signal\" is declared but never explicitly used in the class.\n```","closed_by":{"login":"charjr","id":102669158,"node_id":"U_kgDOBh6bZg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102669158?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr","html_url":"https://github.com/charjr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charjr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110758/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110758/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}